### Product catalog
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products

### Inventory
GET http://localhost:8082/api/inventory/SKU-LAPTOP

### Place an order (catalog prices are authoritative; inventory is reserved)
POST http://localhost:8083/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerEmail": "buyer@example.com",
  "items": [
    {
      "sku": "SKU-LAPTOP",
      "quantity": 1
    },
    {
      "sku": "SKU-HEADPHONES",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### List orders
GET http://localhost:8083/api/orders

### Create a product
POST http://localhost:8081/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-KEYBOARD",
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "Hot-swappable mechanical keyboard",
  "price": 89.99,
  "active": true
}

### Create matching stock
POST http://localhost:8082/api/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-KEYBOARD",
  "availableQuantity": 25
}
